{"source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart", "precision": "tts", "offset": 0, "duration": 88.816, "sentences": [{"text": "Every answer the twin gives can cost money.", "start": 0, "end": 2.311}, {"text": "So it has a ceiling: five dollars a day.", "start": 2.561, "end": 4.863}, {"text": "Every question falls through the same layers.", "start": 5.113, "end": 7.281}, {"text": "The gateway reads the kill switch first, and if it can't read it, it assumes the worst.", "start": 7.531, "end": 12.016}, {"text": "Local answers cost nothing.", "start": 12.266, "end": 13.888}, {"text": "Paid ones are metered to the millionth of a dollar, in the gateway's own database.", "start": 14.138, "end": 18.536}, {"text": "At three fifty, a warning goes out on Telegram and email.", "start": 18.786, "end": 22.026}, {"text": "At five dollars...", "start": 22.276, "end": 23.337}, {"text": "it stops itself.", "start": 23.587, "end": 24.644}, {"text": "One transaction sets the switch, opens an incident, and queues the alert.", "start": 24.894, "end": 29.121}, {"text": "Every request after that gets one line, local answers included.", "start": 29.372, "end": 33.209}, {"text": "\"The twin can't talk right now.", "start": 33.458, "end": 35.105}, {"text": "Today's budget for its answers is used.\"", "start": 35.355, "end": 37.584}, {"text": "A new day doesn't bring it back.", "start": 37.834, "end": 39.372}, {"text": "Only an operator reset does: a person, with a reason, in the audit log.", "start": 39.622, "end": 44.111}, {"text": "The breach test trips it on purpose: fifty-two assertions, fifty-two passed.", "start": 44.361, "end": 48.887}, {"text": "From outside, there's no door: no inbound ports, only an outbound tunnel, and only the gateway has a road out.", "start": 49.137, "end": 55.803}, {"text": "The agents that built it are fenced in too.", "start": 56.053, "end": 58.393}, {"text": "The one that writes never reviews.", "start": 58.643, "end": 60.364}, {"text": "None can touch the budgets or the switch, push, merge, or apply.", "start": 60.614, "end": 64.327}, {"text": "And only Hareet runs the final gate.", "start": 64.577, "end": 66.728}, {"text": "A five-dollar-a-day kill switch.", "start": 66.978, "end": 68.712}, {"text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.", "start": 68.962, "end": 71.304}], "words": [{"word": "Every", "start": 0.5, "end": 1.033}, {"word": "answer", "start": 1.033, "end": 1.389}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.389, "end": 1.567}, {"word": "twin", "start": 1.567, "end": 1.744}, {"word": "gives", "start": 1.744, "end": 2.1}, {"word": "can", "start": 2.1, "end": 2.278}, {"word": "cost", "start": 2.278, "end": 2.455}, {"word": "money", "start": 2.455, "end": 2.811}, {"word": "So", "start": 3.061, "end": 3.218}, {"word": "it", "start": 3.218, "end": 3.375}, {"word": "has", "start": 3.375, "end": 3.532}, {"word": "a", "start": 3.532, "end": 3.689}, {"word": "ceiling", "start": 3.689, "end": 4.003}, {"word": "five", "start": 4.299, "end": 4.654}, {"word": "dollars", "start": 4.654, "end": 5.009}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.009, "end": 5.186}, {"word": "day", "start": 5.186, "end": 5.363}, {"word": "Every", "start": 7.44, "end": 8.031}, {"word": "question", "start": 8.031, "end": 8.426}, {"word": "falls", "start": 8.426, "end": 8.623}, {"word": "through", "start": 8.623, "end": 8.82}, {"word": "the", "start": 8.82, "end": 9.017}, {"word": "same", "start": 9.017, "end": 9.411}, {"word": "layers", "start": 9.411, "end": 9.608}, {"word": "The", "start": 9.858, "end": 10.079}, {"word": "gateway", "start": 10.079, "end": 10.741}, {"word": "reads", "start": 10.741, "end": 10.962}, {"word": "the", "start": 10.962, "end": 11.182}, {"word": "kill", "start": 11.182, "end": 11.403}, {"word": "switch", "start": 11.403, "end": 11.624}, {"word": "first", "start": 11.624, "end": 11.845}, {"word": "and", "start": 12.213, "end": 12.338}, {"word": "if", "start": 12.338, "end": 12.464}, {"word": "it", "start": 12.464, "end": 12.589}, {"word": "can't", "start": 12.589